!results/**/*.json
!results/**/*.md

# Candidate derived files can carry outcomes and are rebuilt from the cleaned
# replication file. The fresh-study design audits are outcome-blind and are
# versioned because config/comparison-v1-lock.yml hashes them.
analysis/candidate/derived/
analysis/candidate/results/
paper/_freeze/
paper/*_files/
paper/*.html
paper/*.pdf
